---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Do It Yourself">
  <h1>Do it yourself</h1>
  <p>
    Feature availability and cost depend on your GitHub plan, repository visibility, and organization
    policies. Check the current documentation before planning a demo. Clone the rehearsal repo for local use:
  </p>
  <pre>git clone https://github.com/ijhan-biz/ship-with-ai-rehearsal.git
cd ship-with-ai-rehearsal
# Use Node 22.12 or later in the Node 22 line.
npm ci
npm test
npm audit --audit-level=high
npm run dev</pre>
  <p>
    Open <code>http://localhost:4321/ship-with-ai-rehearsal/</code> (or the port printed by Astro).
    These safe-branch changes must be reviewed and approved before publication; cloning the remote
    does not guarantee it contains them yet. Do not deploy the historical vulnerable baseline.
  </p>
  <h2>In your repo settings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Code security</strong> — check availability and configure the protections you need. Dependency review and code scanning are not implemented by this build workflow.</li>
    <li><strong>Copilot Code Review</strong> — automatic review requires a configured rule and an eligible account; it has been demonstrated separately for this rehearsal.</li>
    <li><strong>Merge approval</strong> — ordinary GitHub auto-merge is not Agent Merge and does not implement review fixes. Use a manual, approved merge for this rehearsal; Issue → cloud agent and Agent Merge remain unverified.</li>
    <li><strong>Pages</strong> — publication requires Source "GitHub Actions" and a permitted deployment environment. Only an approved push to <code>main</code> deploys; PRs and manual workflow dispatches do not.</li>
    <li><strong><code>.github/dependabot.yml</code></strong> — already configured in this repo for npm version updates.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Resources</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A03_2025-Software_Supply_Chain_Failures/">OWASP Top 10:2025 — A03 Software Supply Chain Failures</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/dependabot">GitHub Docs — Dependabot</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/secret-scanning">GitHub Docs — Secret scanning</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions">GitHub Docs — Security hardening for GitHub Actions</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/get-started/plans">GitHub Docs — Copilot plans and availability</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/configuring-branches-and-merges-in-your-repository/configuring-pull-request-merges/automatically-merging-a-pull-request">GitHub Docs — ordinary pull request auto-merge</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/anothergeorgecoldham/ship-with-ai">Upstream project — original session reference</a></li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
